3. How We Use Your Information\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We use the information we collect to:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Create and manage your account\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Process event registrations and ticket purchases\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Review and process vendor applications\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Send event reminders and updates (with your consent)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Improve our website and services\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Respond to your enquiries and support requests\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Comply with legal obligations\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"legal-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"4. Sharing Your Information\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information with:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Service Providers:\"}],\" Trusted third-party services that help us operate our platform (e.g., Supabase for database hosting, payment processors).\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Event Organisers:\"}],\" Relevant registration details shared with event staff for check-in purposes.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Legal Requirements:\"}],\" When required by law or to protect our rights.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"legal-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"5. Data Storage and Security\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your data is stored securely using Supabase infrastructure with industry-standard encryption. We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosur